  "content": {
    "pages": [
      {
        "id": "about",
        "slug": "about",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "Four people, one loud room.",
          "eyebrow": "About",
          "intro": "The Live Band is a four-piece that has spent six years turning small rooms into the loudest, happiest place in town.",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k1",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "We started in a rented rehearsal space above a hardware shop, playing to whoever wandered up the stairs. Eli wrote songs about the places we drove through, Rafa kept the time, and Tess found the bass lines that made people look up from their drinks.",
                  "_key": "k1s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k2",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Since then the plan has stayed the same: play the songs as if it were the last night of the tour, every night. We would rather be a little rough and completely there than polished and far away.",
                  "_key": "k2s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k3",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "How we play",
                  "_key": "k3s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k4",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "No backing tracks, no click track in the front rows. The set list changes with the room, and the last song is always the one the crowd asks for.",
                  "_key": "k4s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k5",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "We keep our shows all-ages wherever the venue allows it, and every venue on the tour page lists its own door policy so nobody turns up to a surprise.",
                  "_key": "k5s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k6",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Say hello",
                  "_key": "k6s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k7",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Want updates when new dates land, a booking for your venue or festival, or a press kit? Use the contact page and pick the topic; it reaches the right person.",
                  "_key": "k7s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "show-info",
        "slug": "show-info",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "Show info and house rules",
          "eyebrow": "Show info",
          "intro": "What to expect at a Live Band show, from doors to the last song.",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k8",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Before you go",
                  "_key": "k8s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k9",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Doors and start times are on each tour date. Support acts are listed on the show page when they are confirmed. If a date is marked sold out, the venue may release a small number of tickets on the day; we cannot hold or reserve any.",
                  "_key": "k9s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k10",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Looking after each other",
                  "_key": "k10s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k11",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Be kind in the front rows, look out for the person next to you, and tell venue staff if someone needs help. Everyone is here for the same reason.",
                  "_key": "k11s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k12",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Venues set their own bag, camera and re-entry rules. Check the show page first, and write to us from the contact page if you need an accessible space or have a question about getting in.",
                  "_key": "k12s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k13",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Cancellations",
                  "_key": "k13s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k14",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "If a show is cancelled it is marked on the tour page. Tickets bought through a venue are refunded by that venue under its own policy.",
                  "_key": "k14s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "shows": [
      {
